<title>AUSTRALIA: News says editor of The Australian resigns.</title>
<headline>News says editor of The Australian resigns.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-07-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>News Ltd, the Australian arm of Rupert Murdoch's News Corp Ltd, said on Monday that Malcolm Schmidtke had resigned as editor of the group's national daily newspaper, The Australian, effective immediately.</p>
<p>The resignation of Schmidtke, who was appointed editor of The Australian in 1995, follows several management changes since Lachlan Murdoch, Rupert Murdoch's eldest son, became executive chairman of News Ltd last month.</p>
<p>-- Sydney newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
